{"meta":{"id":"tt18069420","type":"movie","name":"Pitufos","description":"Película musical de animación centrada en las icónicas creaciones de Peyo. Cuando Papá Pitufo es secuestrado de forma misteriosa por los malvados brujos Razamel y Gargamel, Pitufina lleva a los Pitufos a una misión al mundo real para salvarle. Con la ayuda de nuevos amigos, los Pitufos deberán descubrir qué define su destino para salvar el universo.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/zBdQclxQnEDOhDOjkKgKPW6jEHh.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9whEVuKte4Qi0LI4TzPf7glinJW.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rwX0f9qHxNODw5o1xQQxSRCAU8u.png","genres":["Animación","Familia","Fantasía"],"releaseInfo":"2025","released":"2025-06-30T00:00:00.000Z","imdbRating":"5.7","runtime":"92 min","trailers":[{"source":"jYtjerVhaSA","type":"Trailer"}],"cast":["Rihanna","James Corden","Nick Offerman","JP Karliak","Dan Levy","Amy Sedaris","Natasha Lyonne","Sandra Oh","Jimmy Kimmel","Octavia Spencer","Nick Kroll","Hannah Waddingham","Alex Winter","Maya Erskine","Billie Lourd"],"director":["Chris Miller"],"writer":["Pam Brady","Rihanna"],"links":[{"name":"Rihanna","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Rihanna"},{"name":"James Corden","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=James%20Corden"},{"name":"Nick Offerman","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Nick%20Offerman"},{"name":"JP Karliak","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=JP%20Karliak"},{"name":"Dan Levy","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Dan%20Levy"},{"name":"Amy Sedaris","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Amy%20Sedaris"},{"name":"Natasha Lyonne","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Natasha%20Lyonne"},{"name":"Sandra Oh","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Sandra%20Oh"},{"name":"Jimmy Kimmel","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Jimmy%20Kimmel"},{"name":"Octavia Spencer","category":"Cast","url":"stremio://